  The article says the protest was held under the 'ஓய்வூதியர்கள் பாதுகாப்பு இயக்கம்' (Tamil Nadu pensioners protection movement) and states it was for 'ஓய்வூதியம் காக்க' — the draft's claim that the movement is 'the organizer' is consistent, so no issue there; however, the caption's phrase 'ஒன்றிய அரசுக்கு எதிர்ப்பு' (opposition to the Union government) in the headline and slides is an interpretive framing not stated in the article, which only says the protest was 'ஒன்றிய அரசை கண்டித்து' in the headline and lists demands.
